## Project Overview

EduGenie is a lightweight AI-powered educational assistant designed to simplify learning through Generative AI.

EduGenie enables users to:

- Ask questions and receive smart answers
- Understand complex concepts through simplified explanations
- Generate quizzes from topics or text
- Receive personalized learning recommendations
- Summarize large educational passages
- Create structured learning paths

The application uses Google Gemini AI to provide intelligent and personalized learning assistance.

## Problem Statement

Creating a suitable learning plan and understanding complex concepts can be difficult because students have different learning requirements, preferences, and levels of understanding.

EduGenie provides an AI-assisted solution for generating personalized and structured learning support based on user input.

