## Project Scenarios

### Scenario 1

A student wants to learn about oceans and rivers. EduGenie provides a simple and understandable answer to the student's question.

### Scenario 2

A student wants to check her understanding of the Pythagoras Theorem. EduGenie can generate a quiz for practice.

### Scenario 3

A learner wants to learn SQL. EduGenie provides a structured learning path with topics and learning suggestions.

